  "hub_safe_radius": 90.0,
  "why": "eight 26 x 22 personal bases and a lobby do not fit inside radius 60; the 90 disc stays inside the beast-free band (x -200 to 340) and outside both region squares (x -100 and x 100). The layout-v1 shared station band (incubadora, corral) is replaced by per-base stations; Refugio, Cofre, Puesto, Tablero, Arbol and trophies are not placed here (decision HB2)",
  "transitions": "the 40-stud transitions shrink to x -100..-90 and 90..100"
 },
